PARAM                             FILE         LIVE         DEFAULT  CONTEXT  DRIFT
arping_cmd                        pgpool.conf  arping -U             restart  
delegate_ip                       pgpool.conf  10.0.0.100            restart  
enable_consensus_with_half_votes  pgpool.conf  on           off      restart  
failover_require_consensus        pgpool.conf  on           on       restart  
failover_when_quorum_exists       pgpool.conf  on           on       restart  
hostname0                         pgpool.conf  db1                   restart  
if_down_cmd                       pgpool.conf  ip addr del           restart  
if_up_cmd                         pgpool.conf  ip addr add           restart  
log_connections                   pgpool.conf  -            off      reload   
max_pool                          pgpool.conf  4            4        restart  
num_init_children                 pgpool.conf  100          32       restart  
pgpool_port0                      pgpool.conf  9999         9999     restart  
use_watchdog                      pgpool.conf  on           off      restart  
wd_port0                          pgpool.conf  9000         9000     restart  
